# Generated by Next.js / TypeScript. These are build artifacts of this
# application, not sources, and must not be committed.
#
# The repo-root `.gitignore` already covers `node_modules/`, `.next/` and
# friends for this app; these two were not listed there and the root file is
# outside this application's boundary, so they are ignored here instead.
#
# Note: `next-env.d.ts` imports `./.next/types/routes.d.ts` and
# `./.next/types/root-params.d.ts`, which are themselves gitignored. The file
# is deliberately left on disk — `npm run typecheck` and `npm run build` both
# need it locally. Only its being *committed* is prevented.
next-env.d.ts

# Incremental TypeScript build info. Belt-and-braces: `tsconfig.json` currently
# redirects this into `.next/cache/` (already ignored above), but a stray
# `tsconfig.tsbuildinfo` in the app root would be an artifact, not a source.
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Build folders of the removed browser suites (long-string gate and live gate,
# removed 2026-11-23, H-test-diet). Still ignored so a folder left on a
# developer machine stays out of `git status`.
.next-longstrings/
.next-live/

# The packaged app's prerendered export (M5-slim): `npm run build:export` writes it
# here and the wheel bundles it (`hatch_build.py`).
.next-export/
